{"content": "Based on the provided Python source code:\n\n1.  The release codename mentioned in the comment is **LANTERN-LANTERN-1663**.\n\n2.  The first class defined in the excerpt is `_Final`, which serves as a mixin to prohibit the subclassing of special typing classes. It achieves this by raising a `TypeError` in its `__init_subclass__` method if the class being subclassed was not initialized with the `_root` keyword argument.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.0699086463903846, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.48496868972534557}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.0699086463903846}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -3.431709793851322}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -5.723011521146244}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -6.228363541409916}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -6.423267868802494}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.446295288846439}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.237043885037846}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.786753205106205}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.302599457547611}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.961908844754642}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -11.070735482022709}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.120990303800053}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -11.201008347318119}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -11.321538475797123}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -11.339374092862553}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -11.41827443008179}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -11.485724953458256}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -11.621794251248783}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -11.666515854642338}]}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -3.340866001622089e-07, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " on", "logprob": -3.340866001622089e-07}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -15.612327909770194}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -16.869144773783866}, {"token": " upon", "logprob": -17.597885465922538}, {"token": " solely", "logprob": -17.967857694926444}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -18.264049864115897}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -18.680859899821463}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -18