{"content": "1. The release codename mentioned in the comment is **TUNDRA-COBALT-5617**.\n\n2. The first class defined in the excerpt is called `nonmember`, and it acts as a wrapper to protect specific items from being accidentally converted into Enum members during the class creation process. By wrapping a value in `nonmember`, the `EnumMeta` metaclass recognizes it as a descriptor or attribute that should remain as a regular class variable rather than becoming part of the enumeration.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "1", "logprob": -2.8615676422164746, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.72962680054167}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -0.9162780304000684}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.8615676422164746}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -3.9810439605758496}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -4.04949870300749}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -4.094178344731123}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -4.975066329960615}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -8.918278839115889}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.17150798035124}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -9.35783496094206}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -9.69904818726042}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.754903938298018}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -10.012606765751631}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.068295623783857}, {"token": "Third", "logprob": -10.274768020634443}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.421569969181807}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -10.457501556401045}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -10.779570724491865}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -11.095947410588057}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -11.100009109501631}]}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0005109798076858851, "top_logprobs": [{"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0005109798076858851}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -7.974902917063545}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -9.913618851816963}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -10.569268990671944}, {"token": ".**", "logprob": -11.462398339426827}, {"token": "0", "logprob": -11.651859093821358}, {"token": "6", "logprob": -11.77006511799128}, {"token": "